# Frontend Environment Variables

# API Configuration
# Use one of the following approaches:

# Option 1: Full API URL (recommended for production)
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:3001

# Option 2: Individual components (more flexible)
# VITE_API_HOST=localhost
# VITE_API_PORT=3001
# VITE_API_PROTOCOL=http:

# If no environment variables are set, the app will automatically
# use the same hostname as the current page (localhost or 127.0.0.1)
# with port 3001. This ensures cookies work correctly in development.
